## V42 — Close every Era 1 classification

### Goal
A single audit pass confirming every one of the 34 topics reached its Era 1-assigned
resolution (new page written, merge executed, or deferral logged) — nothing fell through
between eras.

### Reuses
`inventory/00-topics.docs` and `inventory/01-cross-reference.docs` (Era 1) as the checklist
this version audits against — this is a checklist/audit version, not new writing, mirroring
the sibling roadmap's own Era 12 V42 pattern exactly.

### Implement
- Walk T1–T34 in order; for each, confirm the classification from Era 1 V2 was actually
  executed (page exists / merge landed / deferral is logged with reasoning) — not just
  planned in the era files above.
- Any topic that drifted from its Era 1 classification during Phase 2 (e.g., V16's
  environments-and-variables live decision, V28's cluster-health checkpoint-term addition)
  gets its final resolution recorded here as the source of truth.

### Validate
Zero topics without a traceable resolution.

### Done when
The audit confirms full closure — Phase 3 complete, ready for Era 13's verification pass.
